</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Thy Testaments for man—</l><l>Spoken through men by Spirit borne—</l><l>Reveal Thy hidden plan.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Prophets spoke from of old</l><l>The coming Savior of God’s plan;</l><l>Now through the Son ‘tis told.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word;</l><l>God’s covenant to share;</l><l>God’s promises made real through faith,</l><l>Laid hold of by my prayer.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Just to enjoy Thy Word;</l><l>He’s God expressed, defined;</l><l>My spirit with His Spirit joined,</l><l>God’s grace I’ll surely find.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word;</l><l>Thy constant, written word,</l><l>Mingled with prayer, becomes in me</l><l>Thine instant, spoken word.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Thy words anticipate,</l><l>Cry out at dawn, and hope in them,</l><l>On them to ruminate.</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>The living God to see,</l><l>As hart doth pant for cooling streams,</l><l>I pant, O God, for Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="9."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Flooding my path with light;</l><l>Let it pierce through, illuminate,</l><l>Dispel my heart’s dark night.</l></lg>
<lg label="10."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Do make my heart, good ground!</l><l>Let Thy word’s seed take root and grow,</l><l>That from me fruit abound.</l></lg>
<lg label="11."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>For Thou Thyself didst say,</l><l>Man shall not live by bread alone,</l><l>But by Thy word each day.</l></lg>
<lg label="12."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Coming as crumbs, so small,</l><l>Reaching me in my lowest state,</l><l>To be my all in all.</l></lg>
<lg label="13."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Thy lips bring words of grace;</l><l>Sweeter than honey to my mouth,</l><l>Oh, how it cheers always!</l></lg>
<lg label="14."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>I ate the words I found,</l><l>And they became the gladness, joy,</l><l>That makes my heart resound!</l></lg>
<lg label="15."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Spirit’ual food to me—</l><l>As guileless milk, then solid food—</l><l>Unto maturity.</l></lg>
<lg label="16."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>A two-edged sword to me,</l><l>Which divides spirit from the soul,</l><l>My thoughts, intents to see.</l></lg>
<lg label="17."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Thy Word instructeth me,</l><l>It is God-breathed to make complete</l><l>The man of God in me.</l></lg>
<lg label="18."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>God’s proclaimed Jubilee!</l><l>From sin released, to land returned—</l><l>We’re made God’s family!</l></lg>
<lg label="19."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Which each day fresh does fall,</l><l>As heaven’s manna coming down,</l><l>To be our all in all.</l></lg>
<lg label="20."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Save from fall’s sin and stain;</l><l>Reconstitute with manna pure;</l><l>Thy holy people gain.</l></lg>
<lg label="21."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Our daily, sure supply;</l><l>Eating this manna heavenly,</l><l>Thy church we’ll build thereby.</l></lg>
<lg label="22."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Hold forth the word of life;</l><l>God’s luminaries, blameless, shine,</l><l>Amidst this world of strife.</l></lg>
<lg label="23."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>With it, go forth to sow,</l><l>Watering men’s hearts faithfully,</l><l>That God may cause to grow.</l></lg>
<lg label="24."><l>Just to enjoy Thy Word,</l><l>Our hearts with love o’erflow,</l><l>With one another, Christ we share,</l><l>Thy Body thus doth grow.</l></lg>
<lg label="25."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Let Christ’s word richly dwell,</l><l>Speak, teach, admonish, sing with grace</l><l>To saints and God as well.</l></lg>
<lg label="26."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word;</l><l>The speaking Spirit, hear;</l><l>As Son of Man midst lampstands moves,</l><l>Cares for His churches dear.</l></lg>
<lg label="27."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word;</l><l>Thy truth doth sanctify,</l><l>Become our full reality,</l><l>And oneness bring thereby.</l></lg>
<lg label="28."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>To be prepared His bride;</l><l>We’re by its washing, cleansing pow’r</l><l>Made holy, glorified!</l></lg>
<lg label="29."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>The Spirit’s sword receive;</l><l>By means of prayer, petitioning,</l><l>We victory achieve.</l></lg>
<lg label="30."><l>Just to enjoy Thy word,</l><l>Richly, in many ways,</l><l>Till it is our memorial,</l><l>Throughout eternal days.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
